Before I knew it, I had become a being with a semi-spiritized father and a spirit mother.
A paternal aunt obsessed with my father, and problem-child cousins. Women who kick up a messy template just like an otome game.
Furthermore, for some reason, getting taken a liking to by the person my cousin seemed to be targeting, and engaging in a battle of words with the king. Helping humans, helping spirits, and I''m super busy!
The very moment I learned that those people were ultimately targeting my father.
"I''ll crush them."
