る王家達。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/63/", "translated": true, "import_order": 63, "chapter_number": 63, "sequence_number": 63, "source_episode_id": "63"}, {"id": "64", "num": 64, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/64/", "title": "精霊の儀式と救出作戦。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/64/", "translated": true, "import_order": 64, "chapter_number": 64, "sequence_number": 64, "source_episode_id": "64"}, {"id": "65", "num": 65, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/65/", "title": "アウトーーーーッ！！", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/65/", "translated": true, "import_order": 65, "chapter_number": 65, "sequence_number": 65, "source_episode_id": "65"}, {"id": "66", "num": 66, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/66/", "title": "腹黒がバレました。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/66/", "translated": true, "import_order": 66, "chapter_number": 66, "sequence_number": 66, "source_episode_id": "66"}, {"id": "67", "num": 67, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/67/", "title": "腹黒さんはとことん腹黒。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/67/", "translated": true, "import_order": 67, "chapter_number": 67, "sequence_number": 67, "source_episode_id": "67"}, {"id": "68", "num": 68, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/68/", "title": "断罪の予告。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/68/", "translated": true, "import_order": 68, "chapter_number": 68, "sequence_number": 68, "source_episode_id": "68"}, {"id": "69", "num": 69, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/69/", "title": "小さな女神が激怒した。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/69/", "translated": true, "import_order": 69, "chapter_number": 69, "sequence_number": 69, "source_episode_id": "69"}, {"id": "70", "num": 70, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/70/", "title": "アリアの所業。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/70/", "translated": true, "import_order": 70, "chapter_number": 70, "sequence_number": 70, "source_episode_id": "70"}, {"id": "71", "num": 71, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/71/", "title": "存在の証明。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/71/", "translated": true, "import_order": 71, "chapter_number": 71, "sequence_number": 71, "source_episode_id": "71"}, {"id": "72", "num": 72, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/72/", "title": "2章最終話・真相と決意。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/72/", "translated": true, "import_order": 72, "chapter_number": 72, "sequence_number": 72, "source_episode_id": "72"}, {"id": "73", "num": 73, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/73/", "title": "2章までの人物紹介（若干裏設定含）　※ネタバレ注意", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/73/", "translated": true, "import_order": 73, "chapter_number": 73, "sequence_number": 73, "source_episode_id": "73"}, {"id": "74", "num": 74, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/74/", "title": "閑話・お兄ちゃんとにーさま。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/74/", "translated": true, "import_order": 74, "chapter_number": 74, "sequence_number": 74, "source_episode_id": "74"}, {"id": "75", "num": 75, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/75/", "title": "閑話・過去を踏まえて", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/75/", "translated": true, "import_order": 75, "chapter_number": 75, "sequence_number": 75, "source_episode_id": "75"}, {"id": "76", "num": 76, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/76/", "title": "閑話・新たな始まりの予感。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/76/", "translated": true, "import_order": 76, "chapter_number": 76, "sequence_number": 76, "source_episode_id": "76"}, {"id": "77", "num": 77, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/77/", "title": "3章・プロローグ", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/77/", "translated": false, "import_order": 77, "chapter_number": 77, "sequence_number": 77, "source_episode_id": "77"}, {"id": "78", "num": 78, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/78/", "title": "不穏な影。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/78/", "translated": false, "import_order": 78, "chapter_number": 78, "sequence_number": 78, "source_episode_id": "78"}, {"id": "79", "num": 79, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/79/", "title": "ラフィリアのライバル。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/79/", "translated": true, "import_order": 79, "chapter_number": 79, "sequence_number": 79, "source_episode_id": "79"}, {"id": "80", "num": 80, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/80/", "title": "推理と計画。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/80/", "translated": false, "import_order": 80, "chapter_number": 80, "sequence_number": 80, "source_episode_id": "80"}, {"id": "81", "num": 81, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/81/", "title": "テンバール王国とヘルグナー王国。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/81/", "translated": false, "import_order": 81, "chapter_number": 81, "sequence_number": 81, "source_episode_id": "81"}, {"id": "82", "num": 82, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/82/", "title": "変わらない空のように。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/82/", "translated": false, "import_order": 82, "chapter_number": 82, "sequence_number": 82, "source_episode_id": "82"}, {"id": "83", "num": 83, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/83/", "title": "精霊達への説得。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/83/", "translated": true, "import_order": 83, "chapter_number": 83, "sequence_number": 83, "source_episode_id": "83"}, {"id": "84", "num": 84, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/84/", "title": "恵みの土地。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/84/", "translated": true, "import_order": 84, "chapter_number": 84, "sequence_number": 84, "source_episode_id": "84"}, {"id": "85", "num": 85, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/85/", "title": "情報戦の開始。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/85/", "translated": true, "import_order": 85, "chapter_number": 85, "sequence_number": 85, "source_episode_id": "85"}, {"id": "86", "num": 86, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/86/", "title": "心新たな決意。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/86/", "translated": true, "import_order": 86, "chapter_number": 86, "sequence_number": 86, "source_episode_id": "86"}, {"id": "87", "num": 87, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/87/", "title": "遠い昔の約束。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/87/", "translated": true, "import_order": 87, "chapter_number": 87, "sequence_number": 87, "source_episode_id": "87"}, {"id": "88", "num": 88, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/88/", "title": "予想外の再開。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/88/", "translated": true, "import_order": 88, "chapter_number": 88, "sequence_number": 88, "source_episode_id": "88"}, {"id": "89", "num": 89, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/89/", "title": "新しい事業。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/89/", "translated": true, "import_order": 89, "chapter_number": 89, "sequence_number": 89, "source_episode_id": "89"}, {"id": "90", "num": 90, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/90/", "title": "過去に交わした約束。", "unit_type": "chapter", "source_url": "https://ncode.syosetu.com/n2056dn/90/", "translated": true, "import_order": 90, "chapter_number": 90, "sequence_number": 90, "source_episode_id": "90"}, {"id": "91", "num": 91, "url": "https://ncode.syosetu.c