A goddess offers to reincarnate him in another world, so he wishes to be "the strongest being in the world, someone who won''t die even if stabbed," and has her reincarnate him.
It turns out the form he reincarnated into was just a young sapling.
Just as it was about to wither from a lack of water, a slime bestows water upon it.
As he wishes good fortune upon the slime, the slime surprisingly evolves.
Miraculously, the slime had been granted the World Tree''s divine protection.
That''s right, the form he had reincarnated into wasn''t just any young sapling, but a young World Tree sapling.
Goblins and elves come to the grown World Tree...
